{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file contains implementation of a cache backing store that is compatible with the netscape cookies.txt format. It manages cookies through file parsing, lookup, insertion, invalidation, and regeneration, with handling of concurrent processes via file locking. It provides functions for creating, destroying, reading, writing, and expiring cookie data, including support for wildcard matching and detailed parsing of cookie lines.", "external_files": ["<private-lib-core.h>", "<private-lib-misc-cache-ttl.h>"], "external_methods": ["lws_snprintf", "lws_strcmp_wildcard", "lws_buflist_append_segment", "lws_buflist_total_len", "lws_buflist_next_segment_len", "lws_buflist_use_segment", "lws_fi", "lws_now_usecs", "lws_schedule"], "published": ["lws_cache_ops_nscookiejar"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "int nsc_backing_open_lock(lws_cache_nscookiejar_t * cache,int mode,const char * par)", "description": "Opens the cookie jar file with exclusive locking to prevent concurrent modifications during operations.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nsc_backing_close_unlock(lws_cache_nscookiejar_t * cache,int fd)", "description": "Closes the file descriptor and removes the lock file to release lock.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int nscookiejar_iterate(lws_cache_nscookiejar_t * cache,int fd,nsc_cb_t cb,void * opaque)", "description": "Iterates over each line in the cookie file, calling a callback for each line, handling partial reads and line parsing.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int lws_cache_nscookiejar_tag_match(struct lws_cache_ttl_lru * cache,const char * wc,const char * tag,char lookup)", "description": "Checks if a cookie tag matches a wildcard pattern considering path rules.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int nsc_line_to_tag(const char * buf,size_t size,char * tag,size_t max_tag,lws_usec_t * pexpiry)", "description": "Converts a line from the cookie file into a s